OL,4,G1000FLauren Laverne
OL,5,     GAvalon Emerson is in conversation
OL,6,     Gwith Lauren around new album,
OL,7,     GWritten into Changes.
OL,8,G1300FChris Hawkins
OL,9,     GThe weekend is basically here, so
OL,10,     GChris is giving YOU permission to
OL,11,     Gstart the party early... That's
OL,12,     Gright, let's Down Tools with
OL,13,     GLOADS of amazing tunes to get us
OL,14,     Ggoing.
OL,15,G1600FHuw Stephens
OL,16,     GIt's Friday, so Huw is out to
OL,17,     Gprove that any song sounds better
OL,18,     Gwhen it's played on 6 Music by
OL,19,     GHuw Stephens - so let us know
OL,20,     Gwhat you want to hear.
